Built: job-request form (/request/) + team jersey roster tool (/jerseys/), both
for hartfordschools.org staff, linked from the homepage and Info page.
- Job requests: server/routes/requests.js -> job_requests table, emails the lab
  via Resend, artwork in Tigris. Lab view: /admin/requests/ (status + CSV).
- Jersey rosters: server/routes/jerseys.js -> jersey_jobs/jersey_players.
  Coaches revise via "My Rosters" on /jerseys/. Lab view: Jersey Rosters tab on
  /admin/orders/ (per-roster CSV).

To finish going live:
  1. fly secrets set RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxx        (verify madein.school in Resend first)
  2. fly storage create                          (injects AWS_* + BUCKET_NAME for Tigris)
  3. Deploy. Without 1/2 the tools still work minus email / file uploads.

CT sales tax (6.35%): catalogue price_cents is tax-INCLUSIVE. Tax is split out
of every sale (orders + storefront) and stored per line/txn; "Supplies"
sub-category items are exempt. Income report shows revenue net of tax plus a
"Sales Tax" column. Migration v6 back-fills existing rows (classified by the
item's CURRENT sub-category). Stripe still charges the exact shelf price -- the
split is our-side only; itemising tax on Stripe receipts (a TaxRate with
inclusive:true) is a possible later add.

Still open / possible follow-ups:
  - Let a coach delete their own roster from /jerseys/ (admin can already delete).
  - Order-status email notifications; partial refunds.
  - Optional: itemise CT tax as a line on Stripe Checkout / receipts.
